[.tooling/components/apis/ai-gov-review-service/docs/deployment.md#iam-role-ai-gov-review-pod-role]

#### IAM Role: `ai-gov-review-pod-role`

**Purpose**: Pod role for Kubernetes service account (IRSA - IAM Roles for Service Accounts)

**Trust Policy**:

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [{
    "Effect": "Allow",
    "Principal": {
      "Federated": "arn:aws:iam::<account-id>:oidc-provider/oidc.eks.<region>.amazonaws.com/id/<eks-cluster-oidc-id>"
    },
    "Action": "sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity",
    "Condition": {
      "StringEquals": {
        "oidc.eks.<region>.amazonaws.com/id/<eks-cluster-oidc-id>:sub": "system:serviceaccount:ai-gov-review:ai-gov-review-sa"
      }
    }
  }]
}
```

**Managed Policies**: None

**Inline Policy: `ai-gov-review-policy`**:

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "BedrockAccess",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "bedrock:InvokeModel",
        "bedrock:InvokeModelWithResponseStream"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:bedrock:*:*:model/anthropic.claude-3-5-sonnet-20240620-v1:0"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "S3Access",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "s3:GetObject",
        "s3:PutObject",
        "s3:DeleteObject",
        "s3:ListBucket"
      ],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::ai-governance-reviews",
        "arn:aws:s3:::ai-governance-reviews/*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Sid": "CloudWatchLogs",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "logs:CreateLogGroup",
        "logs:CreateLogStream",
        "logs:PutLogEvents"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:logs:*:*:log-group:/eks/ai-gov-review:*"
    }
  ]
}
```

